OL,3,GNEWSAExhibition explores
OL,4,Amountaineering's origins
OL,5,
OL,6,FMountain climbing's Cumbrian origins
OL,7,Fare being explored in a new exhibition.
OL,9,FThe show at the Beacon Museum in
OL,10,FWhitehaven opened on Saturday and
OL,11,Fdetails the sport's 200-year history in
OL,12,FEngland and Wales.
OL,14,FIt highlights the nation's first known
OL,15,Fmountain climb for recreational
OL,16,Fpurposes which took place on Pillar
OL,17,FRock in the Lake District in 1826,
OL,18,Faccording to the display's curator Ian
OL,19,FSmith.
